    "source_ready": "after 17:10 on an exact official quarter-end signal, both complete captures match, the baseline prefix matches exactly, and the immediate next official session is known",
    "decision_sealed": "before next-session 09:15, select exactly six target rows whose signal_date equals the current signal date and persist the signal-close NAV, account state, target rows and pending sealed-order plan; never fall back to the most recent older target",
    "awaiting_terminal_quarter_close": "the sealed decision executes only at its frozen immediate next official open; missing exact next-open evidence remains unresolved and a later open is never substituted",
    "outcome_confirmed": "after 17:10 on the next natural quarter's last official SSE session, replay only through that close, bind exact next-open execution and daily accounting, and persist the terminal account state before sealing any new decision at the same close",
    "missed_cycle": "if no decision exists by next-session 09:15, that quarter can never be backfilled or relabelled prospective",
